## `environments/dev/dev.tfvars.sops.yaml`

```yaml
# SOPS-encrypted sensitive variables (committed to Git)
# Encrypt with: sops -e --in-place dev.tfvars.sops.yaml
# The tooling (CI) decrypts at deploy time.

# After sops encryption, this file contains:
#   rds_password: ENC[AES256_GCM,data:...,iv:...,tag:...,type:str]
#
# Example (pre-encryption, for illustration only):
# rds_password: "s3cure-d3v-p4ss!"
```

